{ "expectedTotal": 308 }

### 5.12 My requests (history) -> this one: status ACCEPTED, acceptedStoreName "Gupta Kirana",
###      acceptedTotal 297.00, readyBy
GET {{base}}/requests/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{p5c}}

### ---------------- losing store (Sharma) ----------------

### 5.13 Sharma opens it -> outcome LOST, customer/acceptedAt/readyBy null, no pickup code,
###      nothing about Gupta; myQuote.status REJECTED
GET {{base}}/store/requests/{{p5Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{p5s}}

### 5.14 Sharma's CLOSED list -> this request with outcome LOST, customerName null
